{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No-nonsense brawling, arcade style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Vendetta delivers classic side-scrolling combat with modern polish. Inspired by the legendary beat \u2018em ups of the 1990s, it challenges you to master hard-hitting combos, precise timing, and relentless momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/4d4a6f3f617cfad7f9c92706ca9d7003.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/4d4a6f3f617cfad7f9c92706ca9d7003.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/4d4a6f3f617cfad7f9c92706ca9d7003.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets of London are under siege by the Syndic8 gang. When martial artist Claire Sparks\u2019 sister is kidnapped, she joins forces with wrestler Miller T. Williams and bare-knuckle brawler Duke Sancho. Together they will fight through six urban zones to bring her home and crush anyone who stands in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/82c855511fb96b80bd49bd4894723ad6.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/82c855511fb96b80bd49bd4894723ad6.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/82c855511fb96b80bd49bd4894723ad6.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Your Fighter</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claire Sparks: Fast, technical, and deadly with her fists and feet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duke Sancho: A street-smart fighter with powerful punches and flashy style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miller T. Williams: A former pro wrestler built for slams and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character brings a distinct moveset and feel. Master blocking, juggling, running attacks, and more across multiple modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/81fe46bd4acec926b28ad328b2da5ce2.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/81fe46bd4acec926b28ad328b2da5ce2.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/81fe46bd4acec926b28ad328b2da5ce2.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Authentic Arcade Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Vendetta captures the look, sound, and feel of classic coin-op brawlers. It features gorgeous pixel art, responsive controls, and a thumping original soundtrack from Utah Saints, Featurecast, and Krafty Kuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with a friend, this is pure arcade action with no filler and no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/62a8be4a2bf1152eb487323b8c9e98a3.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/62a8be4a2bf1152eb487323b8c9e98a3.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/62a8be4a2bf1152eb487323b8c9e98a3.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid, and unforgiving 2D combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters with unique styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four modes: Arcade, Survival, Versus, Boss Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six distinct stages packed with enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pounding soundtrack featuring UK dance music legends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"THE STREETS CLEARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/330335c794f1704da24ec02dc4b33f95c33d9406.jpg"},{"name":"THE UNDERGROUND CLEARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/685d2d8d32f4aa6460dde48381c74ec52fccf3c7.jpg"},{"name":"THE ELEVATOR CLEARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/b9da5118b2a10aa3301053508a75c319f4656c75.jpg"},{"name":"THE DOCKS CLEARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/ab98778ae28c4a0fd7e151402adf9d055a2fedde.jpg"},{"name":"OUTSIDE THE CLUB CLEARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/5b15fce1df52a87e47d86f96df57fa0b06379625.jpg"},{"name":"THE CLUB CLEARED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/6374960dd1a237e4a0b29fa16cba543fc33a1dc3.jpg"},{"name":"100 KILLS ARCADE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/31bde5354e4bd14ee839b875ebb9b27f86aa6c99.jpg"},{"name":"100 KILLS SURVIVAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/fdc6d7e19ac24b3d0476452bbe49895c00958fe1.jpg"},{"name":"200 KILLS SURVIVAL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/803b5f9e1c9d11285d84a97789a636e34cd9c1b4.jpg"},{"name":"GERMAPHOBE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1891090/9689a1f07c09e76631b15588276ac1b710f74f1d.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1891090?t=1761755487","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761755487","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761755487","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761755487","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>No-nonsense brawling, arcade style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Vendetta delivers classic side-scrolling combat with modern polish. Inspired by the legendary beat \u2018em ups of the 1990s, it challenges you to master hard-hitting combos, precise timing, and relentless momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/4d4a6f3f617cfad7f9c92706ca9d7003.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/4d4a6f3f617cfad7f9c92706ca9d7003.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/4d4a6f3f617cfad7f9c92706ca9d7003.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The streets of London are under siege by the Syndic8 gang. When martial artist Claire Sparks\u2019 sister is kidnapped, she joins forces with wrestler Miller T. Williams and bare-knuckle brawler Duke Sancho. Together they will fight through six urban zones to bring her home and crush anyone who stands in their way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/82c855511fb96b80bd49bd4894723ad6.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/82c855511fb96b80bd49bd4894723ad6.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/82c855511fb96b80bd49bd4894723ad6.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Your Fighter</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claire Sparks: Fast, technical, and deadly with her fists and feet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duke Sancho: A street-smart fighter with powerful punches and flashy style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Miller T. Williams: A former pro wrestler built for slams and chaos</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character brings a distinct moveset and feel. Master blocking, juggling, running attacks, and more across multiple modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/81fe46bd4acec926b28ad328b2da5ce2.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/81fe46bd4acec926b28ad328b2da5ce2.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/81fe46bd4acec926b28ad328b2da5ce2.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Authentic Arcade Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final Vendetta captures the look, sound, and feel of classic coin-op brawlers. It features gorgeous pixel art, responsive controls, and a thumping original soundtrack from Utah Saints, Featurecast, and Krafty Kuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether solo or with a friend, this is pure arcade action with no filler and no mercy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/62a8be4a2bf1152eb487323b8c9e98a3.poster.avif?t=1761755487\" width=612 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/62a8be4a2bf1152eb487323b8c9e98a3.webm?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/extras/62a8be4a2bf1152eb487323b8c9e98a3.mp4?t=1761755487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, fluid, and unforgiving 2D combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three playable characters with unique styles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local co-op support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four modes: Arcade, Survival, Versus, Boss Rush</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six distinct stages packed with enemies and bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty settings and unlockables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pounding soundtrack featuring UK dance music legends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Bitmap Bureau"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1891090/header.jpg?t=1761755487","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Bitmap Bureau Ltd. 2022. Licensed to and published by Numskull Games Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04 and Ubuntu 18.04<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 (x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support)<br>